{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "4be8cf2265c9858b2a467edcafc8f3e9d4548ca25a972a59afae3457deda2cbd", "ja": "突撃♪　お祭り屋台インタビュー！", "zh": "突击♪庙会摊位采访！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "aec4a10fcdc7a6164062c127604b235ca6701f2135b21a809cf6164a662652cd", "ja": "印象に残るシーンについて話す紗代子、\n美奈子と海美は当時の裏話を。\n中継先の奈緒とのり子は、\n賑わう屋台エリアからインタビューを\nお届けします！", "zh": "谈论令人印象深刻场景的纱代子，\n美奈子和海美则分享当时的幕后趣闻。\n在现场连线的奈绪和则子，\n将从热闹的摊位区为大家带来采访！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1000_043nor", "source_sha256": "22092d9ace31d06df44625c51ddb78af1c1956fbd4a1f549c4fac0184351bf58", "ja": "『閃光☆HANABI団★CHANNEL』！", "zh": "《闪光☆HANABI团★CHANNEL》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "22092d9ace31d06df44625c51ddb78af1c1956fbd4a1f549c4fac0184351bf58", "ja": "『閃光☆HANABI団★CHANNEL』！", "zh": "《闪光☆HANABI团★CHANNEL》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "22092d9ace31d06df44625c51ddb78af1c1956fbd4a1f549c4fac0184351bf58", "ja": "『閃光☆HANABI団★CHANNEL』！", "zh": "《闪光☆HANABI团★CHANNEL》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "22092d9ace31d06df44625c51ddb78af1c1956fbd4a1f549c4fac0184351bf58", "ja": "『閃光☆HANABI団★CHANNEL』！", "zh": "《闪光☆HANABI团★CHANNEL》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "22092d9ace31d06df44625c51ddb78af1c1956fbd4a1f549c4fac0184351bf58", "ja": "『閃光☆HANABI団★CHANNEL』！", "zh": "《闪光☆HANABI团★CHANNEL》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "48a6132e496096bde2ed5221ac910af278c5882009f458b699e21aecd1470d78", "ja": "はいっ。というわけで、ロケ地から中継でした！\nなんだか懐かしくなっちゃったね、紗代子ちゃん。", "zh": "好的！那么，刚才是从外景地发来的连线报道！\n\n总觉得变得有些怀念起来了呢，纱代子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "cb03392210a625b157968a15a3a21ffd786dc7e214963d7fb2df18c8246cf508", "ja": "ふふっ、そうですね！　ふたりはこの後、またすぐに\n登場してくれるので、楽しみにしててくださいね！", "zh": "呵呵，是啊！我们两位马上还会再次登场，敬请期待哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "7d2c52ccc8fe523b6eebcf8de75146b5e52245a5578d8851c388627a492c50d8", "ja": "それでは、続いてのコーナーにいきましょう。\nお次は、『キーワードトーク』ですよ！", "zh": "那么，接下来进入下一个环节吧。\n下面是“关键词谈话”环节哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "801c56a3b2b0002a3b45906affa3aa1b419c9271499ab7a3ac26bbf6ee87000c", "ja": "お題となる単語にちなんだ、撮影秘話なんかを披露して\nいきたいと思います。海美ちゃん、お題をどうぞ！", "zh": "接下来想分享一些和题目单词有关的拍摄秘闻之类的。海美，来公布题目吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "938fcdbed65571f19008e286e80e9ad7e74e27722ce36e754d08028e146efa7e", "ja": "はい！　私からのキーワードは、『嵐』だよ！\n嵐といえば……ドラマのあのシーンだよね、さよちん。", "zh": "是！我这边的关键词是“暴风雨”！\n说到暴风雨……就是电视剧里的那个场景吧，纱代亲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "acd3ef2cf00eb01a07fc5285fb9f911f4cadcad8d8b92052f770234489da9cb5", "ja": "うん、そうだね。嵐の中、私がひとりで風除けの\nテントをたてようとするシーンなんですけど……。", "zh": "嗯，是啊。就是在暴风雨中，我一个人\n打算搭起挡风帐篷的那场戏……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "d423b50a6e88edd80a222f47919aafbf2ca52becfd74e3c4a596f9d7ac0408be", "ja": "このドラマの中でもすごく大切なシーンだったから、\n絶対に失敗しないようにって、すごく緊張したな……。", "zh": "因为这是这部剧中非常重要的一幕，我一直紧张得不行，生怕自己演砸了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "3ac4620b9e69030588799b02a98a06da2675ff5eff5c8a9f01eb5b57a1a53076", "ja": "それまでみんなで力を合わせてがんばってきたことが、\nダメになっちゃいそうになるシーンだもんね。", "zh": "毕竟那是大家一直齐心协力努力到现在的成果，仿佛就要功亏一篑的场景嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "8a55a3d806353cf41083ff8c030ac6be1b90f18d8da23b64276b1e7428ec71ce", "ja": "あそこは、紗代子ちゃんひとりのシーンだけど。\n撮影してる間、私たちみんな、泣きそうだったんだよ。", "zh": "那里虽然是纱代子一个人的戏。\n但在拍摄期间，我们大家都差点哭出来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1014_027say", "source_sha256": "1c5231ba7d92c48e3f414b985f226fba44b82b8784d006d1d8927e34221d42dc", "ja": "えっ。そ、そうだったんですか？", "zh": "诶？原、原来是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "6f54678b4c882055f7e86d73bf7ef65a62e600e309af6d511079958a6b6b5db0", "ja": "そうだよー！\nだって私たち、見てるしかなかったから……。", "zh": "就是这样嘛——！\n因为我们当时只能在旁边看着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1016_019min", "source_sha256": "2688ef2461113c8aec7645464633fa2c20aa430d41ce4c00acba949c0c9a3443", "ja": "みんなで確認用のモニター見ながら、\n「がんばれ！」って言ってたんだよね。", "zh": "大家看着确认用的监视屏，\n一起喊着“加油！”呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1017_027say", "source_sha256": "7d29d92e245eb423b5887d1a44c00fcabbb5af0287a56b151875aa8e8e5a28e7", "ja": "全然知らなかった……。\nそういうのって、なんだかうれしいですね。", "zh": "完全不知道……。\n原来大家还做了这种事，感觉真让人高兴呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1018_043nor", "source_sha256": "bfd31d906e5409d76c089092810efca856a3dbc812b0fcebe9ebc2d682586502", "ja": "ちょっとちょっと、みんなー！？\nやっぱりこっちのこと、忘れてない？", "zh": "等等，等等，大家——！？\n果然还是没忘了我吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1019_019min", "source_sha256": "efd23a82972017b87a0b347eb01cd42a6a79adb01fa7fcf711ad6bfe61142bad", "ja": "ハッ！？　わ、忘れてないよ、のり子ちゃん！\nえっと、以上！　キーワードトークのコーナーでした♪", "zh": "哈！？没、没有忘记啦，典子！\n那个，以上！关键词聊天环节到此结束♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "743c77cff59cedc7db6ace2c26cd592447d47368dfe780b9226e880333297ed5", "ja": "ねえねえ、のりさん、なおー！\nふたりは何か、撮影の裏話とかないの？", "zh": "呐呐，纪子、奈绪——！\n你们俩有没有什么拍摄时的幕后趣闻呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1021_043nor", "source_sha256": "eb3355ed4ab0cba7c6ebd9d285ad65de4dd2571138b1f909938ac31ea0eb3baa", "ja": "撮影の裏話かぁ……。\n奈緒、何かある？", "zh": "拍摄的幕后趣闻啊……奈绪，你有什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1022_037nao", "source_sha256": "7ac612dab25c71950fdb3c1f12e15f3b21c6b774a29f7931d714c347932ba623", "ja": "せやなぁ。私は新聞部のエースやったけど、取材シーン\n本編ではほとんど使われへんかったことぐらいかなぁ。", "zh": "是啊。我虽然是新闻部的王牌，不过要说有什么的话，大概就是采访的场景在正篇里几乎没用上吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1023_037nao", "source_sha256": "49d3b90d4fa46c4995169bf2fa255b4093adce8caabae20e42cfe76bb0f6ea75", "ja": "のり子は、なんかモテモテの役やったやん！\nあれ、メッチャ楽しそうやな～と思ったわ～。", "zh": "诺丽子不是演了个超级受欢迎的角色嘛！\n我当时就觉得，那看起来特别开心的样子～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1024_043nor", "source_sha256": "feb51b1b963bd90be1257bf1cbf08ef6164e29f7dd34f1838f0aeb2d490765a0", "ja": "あはっ、そういえばそうだったね！\nたしかに、なんか新鮮で楽しかったけど……。", "zh": "啊哈，说起来还真是呢！\n确实感觉挺新鲜挺开心的，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1025_043nor", "source_sha256": "0e341887473e46f36c20f8ea6ecf83aefc99ba7cecc9171cbb655dcc1b155d84", "ja": "あれ、イヤモニからなんか{$P$}の\n声が……えっ？　そろそろ中継を再開してほしい？", "zh": "咦，耳返里好像传来了{$P$}的声音……诶？是说差不多该重新开始转播了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1026_037nao", "source_sha256": "b3666b1f37efafe5bae2316b8203cabc48cf1d24168a2328853aa592992e03cc", "ja": "あ、せやった。\nしゃべってると、つい進行忘れてまうわ。", "zh": "啊，对哦。光顾着聊天，一不小心就忘了推进流程。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1027_043nor", "source_sha256": "a9bdf3e7cf615b53e9de68773dc5fd26712f98b74a96388a89523533ea90c226", "ja": "それじゃ、再びロケ地の夏祭り会場から中継だよ！\n場所を移動して、屋台が並んでるとこまで来ました！", "zh": "那么，接下来再次从外景地的夏日祭典会场为大家直播！\n我们换了个地方，现在来到摊位林立的地方啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1028_037nao", "source_sha256": "3050c0da88d5c8b22a9d426a2d3735c9fd63adec12a0098fecdd238469b314cc", "ja": "お祭りといえば、やっぱコレ！　屋台飯やんな♪\nああ～、においだけでメッチャお腹空いてきたわ～。", "zh": "说到祭典，果然还是这个！摊贩美食嘛♪\n啊啊～光是闻到香味就觉得特别饿了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1029_043nor", "source_sha256": "cb19224cbc1eed19100878f85aaf38e5689638b6081e4e948815fe633837e0e1", "ja": "そうだね。さっそく、近くのお店に\n突撃してみよっか！　あの、すみませーん！", "zh": "对呀。我们现在就去附近的摊位\n突袭一下吧！那个，不好意思——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1030_takoyakiya", "source_sha256": "164d561176a856732ef54935bc6caec51c9c806b384964fc5ecea25a80e7eef4", "ja": "いらっしゃい。\nたこ焼き、出来たてだよ！　ほら！", "zh": "欢迎光临。\n章鱼烧刚出锅哦！看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1031_037nao", "source_sha256": "66ae81059f8b25022cd5cb6e9fc8082beff784df7be18eab99a6cf0160c73564", "ja": "わあ～！　ありがとう、おっちゃん！\nほな……実食♪", "zh": "哇～！谢谢你，大叔！\n那我就……开吃啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1032_043nor", "source_sha256": "06e42089dfab8ed910bd0690e02bf0b6b378ed649296364453fd971f38bc3c6e", "ja": "おじさん、こんにちは！\n今年のお祭りは、どんな感じ？　盛り上がってる？", "zh": "叔叔，你好！\n今年的祭典怎么样？现场热闹吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1033_takoyakiya", "source_sha256": "fd0eeb93f5582a15e99f4fbe554497ff30a5884a650d52294aff09948790dd93", "ja": "ドラマのおかげで、去年より人出が多い気がするね。\nいや～、あんたらのおかげだよ。ありがとね！", "zh": "多亏了这部剧，感觉人比去年多了呢。\n哎呀～这都多亏了你们。谢谢啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1034_043nor", "source_sha256": "5c9506cf40a29300b93df3a2415017b80401cde420fb31052cd66b0138bd099b", "ja": "うわぁ、よかった～！　閃光☆HANABI団、\nここでも大活躍って感じだね！　へへっ♪", "zh": "哇，太好了～！感觉闪光☆HANABI团\n在这里也大显身手了呢！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1035_043nor", "source_sha256": "469d82ba7fe0a26a4457293a0353e579bcf1f88771ff8512280b6fc71bd6c6f0", "ja": "それじゃ、アタシもたこ焼き食べよ……って、\nもう半分も残ってない！？　ちょっと、奈緒～！？", "zh": "那我也吃章鱼烧吧……咦，已经连一半都不剩了！？喂，奈绪～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1036_037nao", "source_sha256": "8b81113cc2fe1a37c8b5ba8ee3cadb39e42185bc5446b74bca246ab82ec36d77", "ja": "ん～！　口の中でとろけて、メッチャおいしいわ～！\nおっちゃん、もうひとつ追加で！", "zh": "嗯～！入口即化，超级好吃啊～！\n老板，再来一个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1037_043nor", "source_sha256": "d1ea9f369b9a1581e25760948e1252a30c022a73fe7bfffd3f89d32aa1a4d05b", "ja": "あ、ズルい！　おじさん、アタシが先ね！\n……あっ、またレポート忘れるところだった！", "zh": "啊，太狡猾了！叔叔，我先来哦！\n……啊，差点又忘了写报告！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1038_043nor", "source_sha256": "b35c34e869f98c17282fc955359cfb45afa4024d4341ed4a4e1dc3445927d62e", "ja": "こんな感じで、ロケ地はすっごく盛り上がってるよ！\nまた閃光☆HANABI団でライブしに来たいな～。", "zh": "就是这种感觉，外景地的气氛特别热烈！\n真想下次再和闪光☆HANABI团一起来这里举办演唱会啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1039_037nao", "source_sha256": "75e415d355641550a112be8631e8ffaac415be9d969227bcc0de2b23ec6114f3", "ja": "のり子、それ名案やん！\nあとで{$P$}さんに聞いてみよ。", "zh": "典子，那真是个好主意！\n之后去问问{$P$}先生吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1040_043nor", "source_sha256": "07e9abe491ff1a2b2a61924d72d9bcf58a23c9dbe1f70c52c566d2880e95cf34", "ja": "そうだね！\n以上、夏祭りの会場からお届けしましたー！", "zh": "对！\n以上就是从夏日祭典会场发来的报道——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1041_037nao", "source_sha256": "82f601fd23a5b620074daf5014f015feaf6d63aba732eab45a940b0cceffa22f", "ja": "あっ、たこ焼きは持って帰られへんけど、\nお土産話楽しみにしててな♪", "zh": "啊，章鱼烧虽然没法带回去，不过要期待我的旅行见闻哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1043_027say", "source_sha256": "2155182568c3002d40aa5355a321d2c28d1eff7fd127444fcc2bc9f534fa8878", "ja": "奈緒ちゃん、のり子さん、ありがとうございました！", "zh": "奈绪、法子小姐，非常感谢你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0146_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_03_1044_019min", "source_sha256": "41e03e5ce9a6253e9558c7f782206323e58b0eadb3a6cee48c6d630e1f7023bf", "ja": "この後も、番組はまだまだ続きますよ！\nそれではいったん、CMです♪", "zh": "接下来节目还会继续哦！\n那么先进入广告时间♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
